{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act38side_level_act38side_02_beg","storyGroup":"act38side","storySort":4,"storyDependence":"act38side_level_act38side_01_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"PV-2","storyName":"择路","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"陷入两难的伊雷妮前去找拉维妮娅求助，却在旁观了一场庭审后改变了主意，坐上了一辆由白狼开着的出租车离开。与此同时，回到新沃尔西尼的德克萨斯拿出了拉普兰德给她的邀请函。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act38side/level_act38side_02_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act38side_02","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":2,"next":4,"characters":["伊雷妮","拉维妮娅","莱昂图索","法官助理","悲哀的市民","索默尔","德克萨斯","大帝","侃侃而谈的司机"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_bg_56_g11_newvolsiniipier.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":8},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":10},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#5$1","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":11},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"卡车……什么什么……抱歉，您刚刚说的名字实在是太长了。","id":12,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#1$1","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"“新沃尔西尼货运工人和卡车司机联合互助会”……我们需要学习一下维多利亚和哥伦比亚的这种工人组织。","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#7$1","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"要想对抗家族的威胁，首先要让我们自己团结起来，拥有与他们对抗的力量。","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1541_1#1$1","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱昂图索","text":"运输业是一个城市的命脉。在过去，在叙拉古的其他任何一座城市，它始终被家族牢牢掌控着。","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ab/Avg_avg_npc_1541_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱昂图索","text":"我们想要改变这种现状。","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ab/Avg_avg_npc_1541_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱昂图索","text":"在新沃尔西尼，卡车不再是黑帮的快递箱，它只属于驾驶它的人，还有每一个正直的市民。","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ab/Avg_avg_npc_1541_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#5$1","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"可是，为什么是我？","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"我以前只是给索默尔的小超市开车进货……虽然车开得还算可以……","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1541_1#8$1","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱昂图索","text":"在沃尔西尼，没有接受过家族贿赂的市政府职员，两只手就能数得过来。","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_avg_npc_1541_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#2$1","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"那是因为……","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#8$1","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"对不起，伊雷妮。之前我私下调查过你和索默尔的经历。我知道那场惨案，我很抱歉。","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"我在想，如果你只是仇恨纵火焚烧了你们超市的那个家族，你完全可以接受另一个家族的帮助，去完成复仇……","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"但你没有这么做。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#2$1","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"只是我的一点揣测……如果有冒犯，还请原谅。","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#1$1","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"谢谢您……拉维妮娅法官。","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4d/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#9$1","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"伊雷妮，姑且不论你是不是卡车工会负责人的最佳人选，我都相信你是一个善良的人。","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bc/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"请认真考虑一下这份邀请，好吗？","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bc/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#2$1","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"……","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":41},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":42},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":43},{"type":"charslot","id":44},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_bg_56_g5_courtsquare_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":45},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":46},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":47},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":48},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":49},{"type":"animtext","id":50,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_only_medium","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=2>1100年11月6日    4:47 P.M.</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":51},{"type":"animtextclean","id":52},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":53},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":54},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#2$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","id":55},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":56},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_702_1#1$1","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","id":57},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":58},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_702_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":59},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#2$1","focus":"n","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"法官助理","text":"伊雷妮小姐，请稍等。拉维妮娅法官正在主持一场庭审，等结束后就可以来见你了。","id":61},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"好……好的，不着急。","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_702_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"法官助理","text":"你拿着的是要交给拉维妮娅法官的资料吗？我可以先转交给她。","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_702_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"不！还是不用了……一会儿我自己给她吧。","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":68},{"type":"text","text":"伊雷妮说着，将手中的笔记本又攥得紧了一点。","id":69},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_702_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":70},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"请问，拉维妮娅法官这会儿在审的案子是那些企业的纠纷吗，还是、还是和昨晚的车祸有关？","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_702_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"法官助理","text":"哦，都不是。","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_702_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"法官助理","text":"严格意义上说，并不是一场庭审，而是一场可能连拉维妮娅法官都没办法处理的申诉。","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_702_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"法官助理","text":"当事人只是一位普通的新沃尔西尼市民，但情况比较特殊。","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_702_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"她是新沃尔西尼的大法官，有什么案子是她都……我能去听听看吗？","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_702_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"法官助理","text":"当然。那你就在旁听席上等她好了。","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_702_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":81},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":82},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":83},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":84},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":85},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":86},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":87},{"type":"charslot","id":88},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_bg_33_g3_srccourt.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":89},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_wasteland_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":90,"musicid":1},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":91},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":92},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":93},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#1$1","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"……我会尽快联系蒙特卢佩市政府，寻求他们的协助来抓捕凶手。","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"同时，我们也会申请新沃尔西尼法院对这个案件的审判权。","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_696_1#1$1","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲哀的市民","text":"那您能不能告诉我，可能性有多大？","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#1$1","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"……","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"我会尽全力争取。提请异地审判，这一年不是没有过类似的事情——","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_696_1#1$1","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲哀的市民","text":"但是一次都没有成功过，不是吗？","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#7$1","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"……哪怕失败，我也会督促蒙特卢佩的同事公正地审理案件，让凶手得到应有的惩罚。","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_696_1#1$1","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲哀的市民","text":"公正？","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲哀的市民","text":"拉维妮娅法官，要是那样的话，我们都知道会是什么结果！","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲哀的市民","text":"他们会说，是我的哥哥在酒吧喝醉了主动挑事，那几个家族的可怜人只是正当防卫，才失手酿成了意外。","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":110},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_smashtable","volume":"1","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲哀的市民","text":"您知道的，根本不是那么回事！","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲哀的市民","text":"他是因为狂欢节相关的事宜才去蒙特卢佩出差的，结果不小心得罪了当地的家族，被活活打死在了肮脏的巷子里……","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲哀的市民","text":"拉维妮娅法官，我听说那个家族已经请法院的人吃过饭了，您还是想跟我说，您能够督促您的同事公平公正地审理吗？","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#5$1","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"我——","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_696_1#1$1","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲哀的市民","text":"我的哥哥是个好人，他一辈子没有做过什么恶事，我们是最早申请加入新沃尔西尼的市民，大家都很喜欢他……","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#6$1","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"我很遗憾。","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_696_1#1$1","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲哀的市民","text":"您不用遗憾，这种事情在叙拉古再常见不过了，不是吗？","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲哀的市民","text":"拉维妮娅法官，我想报仇。","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲哀的市民","text":"用我自己的方法，用在叙拉古再常见不过的方法……变卖家产，请一个杀手，或者去投靠和那个家族有仇的其他家族。","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲哀的市民","text":"但这样是不是会违反新沃尔西尼法律的规定？","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲哀的市民","text":"您会审判我吗，新沃尔西尼会永远驱逐我吗？","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#6$1","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"……按照《新都市管理法案》，的确如此。","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_696_1#1$1","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲哀的市民","text":"新沃尔西尼的法律是严格的、有效的，可它只在新沃尔西尼严格，只在新沃尔西尼有效……","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲哀的市民","text":"您难道不觉得，这太可笑了吗？","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#2$1","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"……","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"我知道这听起来很残酷，但法律正是如此，新沃尔西尼太过特殊，这是它的意义，也是它目前的缺憾。","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#7$1","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"但请相信我，我们会尽全力帮助你。","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":137},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":138},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":139},{"type":"charslot","id":140},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#2$1","id":141},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":142},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":143},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"n","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲哀的市民","text":"不，拉维妮娅法官，我的哥哥尸骨未寒……","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲哀的市民","text":"我想、我想放弃自己新沃尔西尼市民的身份，回到蒙特卢佩。","id":146},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"……","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"怎么会这样……","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":150},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"w","id":151},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"w","fadetime":"1.5","id":152},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_702_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":153},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":154},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_702_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"法官助理","text":"唉，这是无可奈何的事情。","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_702_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"法官助理","text":"新沃尔西尼是座特殊的城市，《新都市管理法案》无论内容本身，还是效力的来源，都与叙拉古长久以来的历史存在着冲突。","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_702_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"法官助理","text":"从某种意义上讲，它和整个国家都格格不入。也正因为如此，它才必须寸步不让。","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_702_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"法官助理","text":"实际上，像这样的案例，这一年以来我们已经不是第一次遇到了……抱歉，我不该和你讨论这些的。","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_702_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"不，谢谢您……愿意和我讲这些。","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":162},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":163},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":164},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":165},{"type":"charslot","id":166},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_bg_56_g9_truckcamp.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":167},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#10$1","id":168},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":169},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":170},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"伊雷妮，这根本不是互助会能帮我解决的。","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":173},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":174},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":175},{"type":"charslot","id":176},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e0/Avg_bg_56_g14_governmentoffice_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":177},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#1$1","id":178},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":179},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"这里是新沃尔西尼，这里的法律没有任何情面可讲。","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":182},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":183},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":184},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":185},{"type":"charslot","id":186},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_bg_33_g3_srccourt.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":188},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_702_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":189},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":190},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":191},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"……","id":193},{"type":"dialog","id":194},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":195},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_696_1#1$1","focus":"m","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","id":196},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":197},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","focus":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":198},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":199},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":200},{"type":"text","text":"悲哀的男人从两人身旁经过，他一言不发，伊雷妮从他的脸上读不出任何表情。","id":201},{"type":"dialog","id":202},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_702_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"法官助理","text":"伊雷妮小姐，拉维妮娅法官正在处理案件相关的文书，我去跟她说一声，你就在这儿等我。","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_702_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":205},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":206},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":207},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":208},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"……","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":211},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":212},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":213},{"type":"charslot","id":214},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#6$1","id":215},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":216},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":217},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"……","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":220},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_702_1#1$1","posfrom":"100,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":221},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":222},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_702_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"法官助理","text":"拉维妮娅法官，您还好吗？","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_702_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"我没事。伊雷妮呢，你不是说她等了我很久吗？","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_702_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"法官助理","text":"奇怪，刚刚还在这里的。","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_702_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"她有说什么事情吗，查到了那辆逃逸载具的下落？","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_702_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"法官助理","text":"（摇头）","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_702_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"……以她的性格，估计是突然想到了什么新线索，等不及打招呼就走了，她会再联系我们的。","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_702_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"法官助理","text":"对了，刚刚警局的同事来过电话了。","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_702_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"法官助理","text":"您拜托他们找的那个姓切塔尔多的……有下落了。","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_702_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":238},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":239},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":240},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":241},{"type":"charslot","id":242},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_bg_bg_vipward.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":243},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":244},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1028_texas2_1#5$1","id":245},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":246},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":247},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":248},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":249},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":250},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openwindow","volume":"1","id":251},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":252},{"type":"text","text":"德克萨斯将武器放在一边，推开了房间的窗户。","id":253},{"type":"text","text":"她有些无聊。","id":254},{"type":"dialog","id":255},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_saferoom_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":256,"musicid":2},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_animal_loop","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"an","id":257},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"an","fadetime":"2","id":258},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":259},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":260},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_bg_56_g1_newvolsiniistreet_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.5","yScale":"1.5","id":261},{"type":"backgroundtween","yFrom":"-180","yTo":"50","duration":"25","block":"false","id":262},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":263},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":264},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":265},{"type":"text","text":"最近正是雨季，但城市上空几乎看不见一丝阴云，熙熙攘攘的行人沐浴在明媚的阳光里——","id":266},{"type":"text","text":"她差点认不出眼前是自己一年前曾踏足的地块。","id":267},{"type":"text","text":"毕竟去年它们还属于沃尔西尼，还被连绵的阴雨笼罩着，害得自己每天要花许多时间烘干尾巴。","id":268},{"type":"text","text":"如若不是莱昂图索还躺在病房里，德克萨斯差点就要相信叙拉古真的在变好了。","id":269},{"type":"dialog","id":270},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"an","fadetime":"1","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"……","id":272},{"type":"dialog","id":273},{"type":"bg","id":274,"from":"0","to":"1","duration":"3","block":"false"},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":275},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":276},{"type":"charslot","id":277},{"type":"background","id":278},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1028_texas2_1#3$1","id":279},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_bg_bg_bar_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":280},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":281},{"type":"bg","id":282,"from":"1","to":"0","duration":"3","block":"false"},{"type":"char","from":"1","to":"0","duration":"3","block":"false","id":283},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":284},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"老板，你把这些黑胶唱片也塞进行李箱里，不怕被刮花？","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_105_emper","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"有什么办法！","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"我可不喜欢叙拉古那些故作轻松的爵士乐，乍一听好像很优雅，实际上跟狼群撕来咬去时尾巴毛刷地的动静没区别。","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"狂欢节、游行、演出……肯定到处都是音乐，我只是想见见老朋友，可不想耳朵被侮辱。","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1028_texas2_1#3$1","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"老朋友？你的同胞也会去吗？","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_105_emper","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"我们以前就常去，过了这么久，叙拉古人又搞起了这个主题派对，那些家伙肯定会去凑热闹的。","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"喂喂，德克萨斯，嘴上嚷嚷着不感兴趣，行李却收拾得比我还快？","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1028_texas2_1#2$1","id":296},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"本来就没有什么要带的。","id":297,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"我们也不会待很久，事情结束就回来。","id":299,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_105_emper","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"你一股子笃定这次肯定又会发生什么乱子的口气。","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"说真的，扎罗输掉了他的游戏，你们的交易已经作废……","id":302,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"你和叙拉古，和那些老熟人，确实有些我压根不感兴趣的纠缠，但该解决的都已经解决了。","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"“最后的德克萨斯”已经翻篇了，你对叙拉古又谈不上有什么了不得的期待，那地方变好还是变差，和你又有什么关系？","id":304,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1028_texas2_1#8$1","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"……","id":306,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5d/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_105_emper","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"不想说，还是你自己也说不上来？","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"算了，反正我可是给过你机会，让你留在龙门看家的。","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":310},{"type":"bg","id":311,"from":"0","to":"1","duration":"3","block":"false"},{"type":"char","from":"0","to":"1","duration":"3","block":"false","id":312},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":313},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":314},{"type":"charslot","id":315},{"type":"background","id":316},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1","id":317},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_bg_bg_vipward.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":318},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":319},{"type":"bg","id":320,"from":"1","to":"0","duration":"3","block":"false"},{"type":"char","from":"1","to":"0","duration":"3","block":"false","id":321},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":322},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"……","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":325},{"type":"text","text":"德克萨斯关上了窗户，从外套内侧的口袋掏出两个信封。","id":326},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper1","volume":"1","id":327},{"type":"text","text":"第一封是来自新沃尔西尼市政厅的邀请函，上面印着法院的公章和代理市长莱昂图索的签名。","id":328},{"type":"text","text":"另一个信封里面空空如也，紫色封面的角落潦草地画着一只白狼，和一串葡萄。","id":329},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1028_texas2_1#7$1","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"……拉普兰德。","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":332},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":333},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":334},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":335},{"type":"charslot","id":336},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_bg_56_g5_courtsquare_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":337},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":338},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_noisycitytraffic","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"n","id":339},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.5","channel":"n","fadetime":"2","id":340},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":341},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":342},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":343},{"type":"text","text":"伊雷妮逃也似的离开了法院。","id":344},{"type":"text","text":"刚才发生了什么，自己经历了什么，又做了什么样的挣扎，她全然不敢回顾。","id":345},{"type":"text","text":"一辆出租车停在了她面前，伊雷妮忘了自己有没有招手。","id":346},{"type":"dialog","id":347},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"n","fadetime":"2","id":348},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drivestop","volume":"1","id":349},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":350},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":351},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.11","fadetime":"0.1","id":352},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.11","fadetime":"0.1","id":353},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":354},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":355},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":356},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#2$1","afrom":"0","ato":"0","duration":"0","id":357},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.1","duration":"0","id":358},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":359},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"300,0","posto":"0,0","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":360},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":361},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cardoorc","volume":"1","id":362},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":363},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"侃侃而谈的司机","text":"去哪里？","id":365},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#2$1","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"卡车营地……","id":367,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"侃侃而谈的司机","text":"哦，是没听过的地方。","id":369},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#2$1","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"都灵区，亚力托大街500号。","id":371,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"是最外围地块，离这里很远，你没载过去那儿的客人也很正常。","id":372,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":373},{"type":"playsound","key":"$sportscarstart","volume":"0.5","id":374},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":375},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_driveincar","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"car","id":376},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"-1","xstrength":"0.4","ystrength":"0.4","vibrato":"10","randomness":"10","fadeout":"false","block":"false","id":377},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"car","fadetime":"2","id":378},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.1","duration":"2","id":379},{"type":"backgroundtween","xScaleFrom":"1","yScaleFrom":"1","xScaleTo":"1.4","yScaleTo":"1.4","duration":"4","block":"false","id":380},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":381},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":382},{"type":"charslot","id":383},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_bg_56_g1_newvolsiniistreet_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":384},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$mist_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_mist_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":385,"musicid":3},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.2","channel":"car","fadetime":"2","id":386},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":387},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#1$1","id":388},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":389},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":390},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"侃侃而谈的司机","text":"不顺的一天，对吧？","id":392},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#3$1","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"嗯……","id":394,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"侃侃而谈的司机","text":"可怜的人，你是我来到新沃尔西尼后见到的最不开心的客人。","id":396},{"type":"dialogue","name":"侃侃而谈的司机","text":"为什么这么闷闷不乐呢？再有几天就是狂欢节巡游了，大家都在为这座新城市和自己的新生活开心不是吗？","id":397},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#3$1","id":398},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"……","id":399,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":400},{"type":"dialogue","name":"侃侃而谈的司机","text":"说起来，我对这里可是喜欢得不得了。","id":401},{"type":"dialogue","name":"侃侃而谈的司机","text":"看这张灯结彩的街道、美妙的派对，食物也很讲究。没有家族，也很少下雨。空气和尾巴永远都是干燥的。","id":402},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#3$1","id":403},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"司机小姐，安静一点好吗？我现在不想说话。","id":404,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":405},{"type":"dialogue","name":"侃侃而谈的司机","text":"唉，这位客人，到底有什么心事呢？不如聊聊嘛，说不定我能帮到些什么忙呢？","id":406},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#3$1","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"……","id":408,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#7$1","id":409},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"我做错了一些事，不，应该说，我没有做到一些事。或者说，我相信了不该相信的人……总之，我辜负了别人的信任。","id":410,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#3$1","id":411},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"算了吧，我遇到的问题……没法解决。","id":412,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":413},{"type":"dialogue","name":"侃侃而谈的司机","text":"不不不，在叙拉古，没什么问题是不能解决的。","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"侃侃而谈的司机","text":"解不开的绳结可以用刀劈开，打不开的密码箱也可以用锤子砸烂，所有问题都是这样。","id":415},{"type":"dialogue","name":"侃侃而谈的司机","text":"很多时候，你要做的只是换一种思路，给自己加上一点点胆量。然后你就会发现，所有问题都会迎刃而解的。","id":416},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#2$1","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"你很有经验吗？","id":418,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"侃侃而谈的司机","text":"超乎你的想象，尊敬的客人。","id":420},{"type":"dialogue","name":"侃侃而谈的司机","text":"毕竟我在成为一名出租车司机之前，主要的工作就是帮我最好的朋友解决麻烦。","id":421},{"type":"dialogue","name":"侃侃而谈的司机","text":"那可是一个，很能惹麻烦的人，啧。","id":422},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#8$1","id":423},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"号称能帮别人解决麻烦，听起来就像是家族的做派。","id":424,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":425},{"type":"dialogue","name":"侃侃而谈的司机","text":"那你就误会我了。","id":426},{"type":"dialogue","name":"侃侃而谈的司机","text":"这里是新地方，已经不兴过去的那套做法了，我很清楚。","id":427},{"type":"dialogue","name":"侃侃而谈的司机","text":"看啊，人人都热情洋溢，人人都满怀爱意，还有，人人都戴着狂欢的面具。多有趣。","id":428},{"type":"dialogue","name":"侃侃而谈的司机","text":"有时候我真的很好奇，你说这些人的面具之下，到底藏着什么样的表情？","id":429},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#4$1","id":430},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"我不明白你在说什么。","id":431,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":432},{"type":"dialogue","name":"侃侃而谈的司机","text":"很简单，因为别人的约束而戴上的假面，是会让自己透不过气来的。","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"侃侃而谈的司机","text":"很多时候，其实你知道该怎么做，答案就在那里，再清楚不过。只是我们出于种种别的原因，拒绝直视它。","id":434},{"type":"dialogue","name":"侃侃而谈的司机","text":"可是，如果能让自己轻松一点的话……为什么不呢？","id":435},{"type":"dialog","id":436},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":437},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#5$1","id":438},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"……不好意思，请停一下。","id":439,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":440},{"type":"playsound","key":"$drift","volume":"1","id":441},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"car","fadetime":"1","id":442},{"type":"backgroundtween","xScaleFrom":"1.1","xScaleTo":"1.2","yScaleFrom":"1.1","yScaleTo":"1.2","duration":"0.5","block":"false","id":443},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.05","duration":"0.5","isblock":"true","id":444},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":445},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":446},{"type":"backgroundtween","xScaleFrom":"1.2","xScaleTo":"1.05","yScaleFrom":"1.2","yScaleTo":"1.05","duration":"0.2","block":"false","id":447},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"0.98","duration":"0.2","isblock":"true","id":448},{"type":"backgroundtween","xScaleFrom":"1.05","xScaleTo":"1.1","yScaleFrom":"1.05","yScaleTo":"1.1","duration":"0.2","block":"false","id":449},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1","duration":"0.2","isblock":"true","id":450},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":451},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":452},{"type":"text","text":"司机利落地踩下了刹车。","id":453},{"type":"text","text":"不知道为什么，乘客有种感觉，好像从上车开始，司机就在期待着自己的这个指令，她甚至在后视镜里看到了对方灿烂的微笑。","id":454},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#8$1","id":455},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"我不去卡车营地了，去另一个地方。","id":456,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":457},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":458},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":459},{"type":"charslot","id":460},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.2","fadetime":"0.1","id":461},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.2","fadetime":"0.1","id":462},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_bg_56_g1_newvolsiniistreet_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.4","yScale":"1.4","y":"-250","x":"-100","fadetime":"0","id":463},{"type":"backgroundtween","xFrom":"-100","xTo":"0","duration":"4","id":464},{"type":"bg","id":465,"from":"0","to":"1","duration":"0.1","block":"false"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1564_1#3$1","posfrom":"-100,-200","posto":"0,-200","duration":"4","id":466},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.8","duration":"0","id":467},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":468},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":469},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":470},{"type":"dialogue","name":"侃侃而谈的司机","text":"听您吩咐，尊敬的客人。","id":471},{"type":"dialog","id":472},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_carspeedup","volume":"1","id":473},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":474},{"type":"backgroundtween","xScaleFrom":"1.4","yScaleFrom":"1.4","xScaleTo":"1.6","yScaleTo":"1.6","duration":"2","id":475},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":476},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":477},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":478},{"type":"charslot","id":479},{"type":"background","id":480},{"type":"image","id":481}],"characters":["伊雷妮","拉维妮娅","莱昂图索","法官助理","悲哀的市民","索默尔","德克萨斯","大帝","侃侃而谈的司机"]}